Schema migrations, on an async engine.

Generated with `alembic init -t async`; the default template is synchronous and cannot
drive the async engine this project uses. `env.py` explains the three changes made to it.

    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "what changed"
    uv run alembic upgrade head
    uv run alembic downgrade -1

The database URL comes from DATABASE_URL (or .env), never from alembic.ini.
